_pika","author_link":"https://twitter.com/barrier_pika/status/1162735837517242369","author_icon":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1193928647607894016/JiQ7xRMK_normal.jpg","text":"おっさんです… \u003chttps://pbs.twimg.com/media/ECLeFC6U4AE-zei.jpg\u003e","image_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/ECLeFC6U4AE-zei.jpg","blocks":null,"footer":"Twitter","footer_icon":"https://a.slack-edge.com/80588/img/services/twitter_pixel_snapped_32.png","ts":1566052800,"service_name":"twitter","from_url":"https://twitter.com/barrier_pika/status/1162735837517242369?s=19","original_url":"https://twitter.com/barrier_pika/status/1162735837517242369?s=19"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"PPd"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6079e8e2-794b-452a-9e9f-c9275643a3b6","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"僕は新卒1年目なのでオジサンではないです（？）","ts":"1625327802.097500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"0MzOy"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2E51CF9C-B52A-4ABD-997A-4F4CD02E981B","type":"message","user":"U022TD5GGKE","text":"そこに気づくとはやはりおじさ","ts":"1625327793.097200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"r01"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d22f21ac-b345-4e3c-9d3c-0c89781abdfd","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"実はもうすでにおじさんだという説はないだろうか","ts":"1625327675.095400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"FSF"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f5916771-fe59-4d08-8620-fdcf0c8a0652","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"この道のりがどれくらい長いのか、それすら人類はまだ知らない","ts":"1625327476.094900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"aD9j"}]},{"client_msg_id":"47ac7b07-59de-4dd3-8cb6-70c347d47d34","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"オモチャと道具の間にはまだまだ長い道のりがありますね","ts":"1625327445.094300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"0rj"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d6b13d76-95d0-4a32-821d-94b2f86fbbd3","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"おじさんになる頃にようやく実用化されるような技術だと思っていたので","ts":"1625327245.093200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"yhs"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b3a7231f-0928-4ce4-a373-68c59f5ca7ff","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"自分が想像していたより進展早かった","ts":"1625327219.093100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Txpiq"}]},{"client_msg_id":"083913f1-331f-48a0-ac26-f71c0cb3b965","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"最近の進展は研究者のオモチャだったのが開発者のオモチャまで敷居が下がってきたということです（それはそれでとても良いこと）","ts":"1625327046.093000","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"goodpoem","count":2,"users":["U9S4G0LJW","U027BQYM708"]},{"name":"sorena","count":1,"users":["U022TD5GGKE"]},{"name":"naruhodo","count":1,"users":["U013QL1RAPN"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"CMA"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0d5a23d8-7fc5-4b8a-9064-388cca94e7ac","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"量子コンピュータは*原理的に*古典コンピュータより高速になることを*期待されている*、であってまだまだオモチャですね","ts":"1625326975.091500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Q6k"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d21b1052-fe3c-48aa-b3e1-819c996830a8","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"分野外の人が量子コンピュータについて語るのを見るたびにモヤッとしていたけど、いま説明するのもなあっていつも思っていた\nこれからはこれを貼ろう","ts":"1625326818.089700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"f2V7h"}]},{"client_msg_id":"44e3e27f-5c71-4321-bf5c-2847ba8ef284","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"話ぶった切るけどいい記事なのではっておきます\n\u003chttps://tasusu.hatenablog.com/entry/2021/07/03/131243|https://tasusu.hatenablog.com/entry/2021/07/03/131243\u003e","ts":"1625326743.087700","attachments":[{"fallback":"むしゃくしゃしてやった，今は反省している日記: 「量子」と組合せ最適化に関する怪しい言説 ―とある研究者の小言― - むしゃくしゃしてやった，今は反省している日記","id":1,"title":"「量子」と組合せ最適化に関する怪しい言説 ―とある研究者の小言― - むしゃくしゃしてやった，今は反省している日記","title_link":"https://tasusu.hatenablog.com/entry/2021/07/03/131243","text":"最近，量子コンピュータの話題をニュースや新聞で見かけることが増えてきました．その中で気になってきたのが，組合せ最適化と量子コンピュータ（特に量子アニーリング）に関する怪しい言説．私自身は（古典コンピュータでの）組合せ最適化の研究をやってきて，量子コンピュータを研究しているわけではないのですが，さすがにこれはちょっと・・・と思う言説を何回か見かけてきました．最近の「量子」に対する過熱ぶりは凄まじいので，こういう怪しい言説が広まるのは困りものです．すでにTwitter上には，“組合せ最適化は今のコンピュータでは解けない”とか“でも量子なら一瞬で解ける”という勘違いをしてしまっている人が多数見られま…","image_url":"https://cdn-ak.f.st-hatena.com/images/fotolife/t/tasusu/20210630/20210630092544.jpg","blocks":null,"ts":1625285563,"service_name":"むしゃくしゃしてやった，今は反省している日記","service_icon":"https://tasusu.hatenablog.com/icon/touch","from_url":"https://tasusu.hatenablog.com/entry/2021/07/03/131243","original_url":"https://tasusu.hatenablog.com/entry/2021/07/03/131243"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"+1","count":1,"users":["U06BRP8VD"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"VGYlc"}]},{"client_msg_id":"262293cc-dd84-4643-9a9f-c5c726c37ab4","type":"message","user":"UD1FQV38V","text":"commit messageもそうだけど、何故を書かないとわからなくなりますよね","ts":"1625325827.087000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"3IT55"}]},{"client_msg_id":"42e13bad-211c-472d-82c0-971b4b3273f9","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"プログラミングのコメントしかり","ts":"1625325551.086500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"JvV"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c94dad9b-feb1-4d7e-8711-a6b3c5cb7db9","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"whyだいじ","ts":"1625325535.086400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"e1Yz0"}]},{"client_msg_id":"477b1592-c44c-499f-9072-08b11